From 913fd8534c0cd06e108dd5694686ba1c300c2e96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 14:41:37 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Nanquim: tirar o painel Propriedades de Texto do Android
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

No Galaxy Tab S10 Lite, criar esse painel (QML) levava 60,6 s de um
total de 73,5 s na abertura do app (log de uso, segunda abertura).
A ferramenta de texto continua funcionando: ela já trata a ausência
do painel (SvgTextTool verifica se dockWidget("TextProperties") existe).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012fwRUW9SkxqcJFLYxLRXTf
---
 plugins/dockers/CMakeLists.txt | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/plugins/dockers/CMakeLists.txt b/plugins/dockers/CMakeLists.txt
index 0052549..54d01c9 100644
--- a/plugins/dockers/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/plugins/dockers/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -53,4 +53,6 @@ if (NOT ANDROID) # Nanquim: fora do pacote Android
 endif()
 add_subdirectory(widegamutcolorselector)
 add_subdirectory(brushhud)
-add_subdirectory(textproperties)
+if (NOT ANDROID) # Nanquim: este painel QML levava ~60 s para abrir no Galaxy Tab S10 Lite
+    add_subdirectory(textproperties)
+endif()
-- 
